{"title":"Career roadmap · Industrial Robot Programmer","role":"Industrial Robot Programmer","summary":"An Industrial Robot Programmer develops, configures, tests and optimises robot programs used in manufacturing and industrial automation. The role combines robot programming, PLCs, sensors, motion control, machine vision, industrial networking, safety and production-process knowledge.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Timeline assumption":"Four-year B.Tech/B.E. beginning in 2026 and graduating around 2030."},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Industrial Robot Programmer is a directly aligned career for Robotics & Automation Engineering. Entry-level candidates may also be hired as Robot Programmer, Robotics Engineer, Automation Engineer, Controls Engineer or Graduate Engineer Trainee."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build programming, robotics, PLC, control, sensors, CAD and industrial automation fundamentals."},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Specialise in industrial robot programming, robotic welding, assembly, material handling, machine vision or robot-cell integration."},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Progress toward robot-cell ownership, automation integration, optimisation and commissioning leadership."},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Move toward advanced robotics, collaborative robots, autonomous systems, digital twins and robotic systems architecture."}],"sections":[{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Python/C++, mathematics, physics and basic electronics"},{"text":"Python Documentation · NPTEL","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"},{"text":"Basic robotics/control programs"},{"text":"Programming, analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Sensors, actuators, motors and microcontrollers"},{"text":"Arduino Documentation","url":"https://docs.arduino.cc/"},{"text":"Sensor-controlled robotic prototype"},{"text":"Technical foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Robotics kinematics, dynamics and control"},{"text":"Modern Robotics","url":"https://modernrobotics.northwestern.edu/"},{"text":"Forward/inverse kinematics implementation"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"PLC programming, industrial automation and HMI"},{"text":"Siemens Automation","url":"https://www.siemens.com/global/en/products/automation.html"},{"text":"PLC-controlled robot-cell simulation"},{"text":"Industrial execution"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Industrial robot programming and coordinate systems"},{"text":"ABB Robotics · FANUC","url":"https://new.abb.com/products/robotics"},{"text":"Simulated/programmed pick-and-place or assembly task"},{"text":"Robot programming"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Machine vision, end-effectors and robot-cell integration"},{"text":"Cognex Vision Academy","url":"https://www.cognex.com/education"},{"text":"Vision-guided robot project"},{"text":"Systems thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Industrial networking, safety and production optimisation"},{"text":"PROFINET · ISO","url":"https://www.profibus.com/technology/profinet"},{"text":"Robot + PLC + vision + HMI integrated cell"},{"text":"Digital literacy"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Industrial robotics internship + capstone"},{"text":"KUKA Robotics","url":"https://www.kuka.com/"},{"text":"Complete robot-cell project with cycle-time and safety analysis"},{"text":"Ownership, communication"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core technical subjects to master"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming fundamentals"},{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Electrical/electronics fundamentals"},{"text":"Sensors and actuators"},{"text":"Microcontrollers"},{"text":"Robotics kinematics"},{"text":"Robotics dynamics"},{"text":"Motion control"},{"text":"PLC programming"},{"text":"HMI/SCADA"},{"text":"Industrial robot programming"},{"text":"Machine vision"},{"text":"Industrial networking"},{"text":"Robot safety"},{"text":"CAD/CAM"},{"text":"Manufacturing processes"},{"text":"Robot-cell integration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"Use the additional year for advanced robot programming, machine vision, collaborative robots, autonomous navigation, digital twins or an industry-sponsored robotic-cell project."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Robot Programming"},{"text":"Robot languages, teach pendant, trajectories, frames, I/O"},{"text":"FANUC Robotics","url":"https://www.fanuc.com/"},{"text":"Senior Robot Programmer"}],[{"text":"Robotic Welding"},{"text":"Welding processes, robot paths, fixtures, safety"},{"text":"ABB Robotics","url":"https://new.abb.com/products/robotics"},{"text":"Robotic Welding Engineer"}],[{"text":"Assembly & Material Handling"},{"text":"Pick/place, conveyors, end-effectors"},{"text":"KUKA Robotics","url":"https://www.kuka.com/"},{"text":"Robotics Integration Engineer"}],[{"text":"Machine Vision"},{"text":"Cameras, image processing, inspection"},{"text":"Cognex","url":"https://www.cognex.com/"},{"text":"Vision & Robotics Engineer"}],[{"text":"PLC/Robot Integration"},{"text":"PLC, fieldbus, HMI, robot I/O"},{"text":"Siemens Automation","url":"https://www.siemens.com/global/en/products/automation.html"},{"text":"Robotics Automation Lead"}],[{"text":"Collaborative Robotics"},{"text":"Cobots, force sensing, safety, human-robot interaction"},{"text":"Universal Robots","url":"https://www.universal-robots.com/"},{"text":"Collaborative Robotics Engineer"}],[{"text":"Advanced Robotics"},{"text":"ROS 2, perceptio